<%# The public demo says what it is on every page, the sign-in included (#952).
    It cannot be dismissed.
    It is the first thing in the page, so a screen reader reads it first, and it is a labelled region, so it is listed among the page's landmarks.
    Its head styles are in _demo_banner_style. %>
<% if demo_mode? %>
  <div
    id="demo-banner"
    class="lr-demo-banner"
    role="region"
    aria-label="Test environment"
  >
    <p>
      <strong>Test environment.</strong>
      Synthetic data only.
      Data may be reset at any time; anything you enter can be erased.
    </p>
  </div>
<% end %>
